        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 18207e15-3ef6-41a3-a342-3c6e638222b6).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client wants to cripple the local biker gang&apos;s drug operation present within Berlin. The first two targets on your list are in charge of cocaine production. I recommend blowing up their laboratory - with what, well, that&apos;s up to you. Our other two targets are growing Marijuana in the green room. Poisoning the spray isn&apos;t a bad idea... Our client  prefers if you do it quick, but doesn&apos;t wish to deduct anything based on time of completion.\r\rGet it done, and good luck.\r\r-Rijo",
